=== MDV-P9-019
title: No-show risk on tomorrow's list, as an explained draft
type: Story
epic: MDV-P9-E06
prd: P9-07
priority: COULD
roles: Receptionist
labels: ai, scheduling
estimate: 3
weeks: 73-74
depends: MDV-P9-001, MDV-P4-030
confidence: 50 | Needs enough history per clinic; may start rule-based.
sources: DentalERP lib/ai/skills/no-show-predictor.ts; app/api/ai/no-show-risk
desc:
Tomorrow's appointments show a risk label (Low, Medium, High) with the reasons in words (past no-shows, booking lead time, unconfirmed). The desk decides whether to call; nothing is sent automatically.
ac:
- The label is shown as an AI draft (DESIGN.md principle 8) with its reasons.
- With fewer than 3 months of clinic history the label is not shown.
notes:
- Pick up from DentalERP: the input factors in no-show-predictor.ts; start with those rules before any model.

