=== MDV-P9-022
title: Ask a question about clinic reports in plain English
type: Story
epic: MDV-P9-E06
prd: P9-07
covers: exit:2
priority: COULD
roles: Owner
labels: ai, reports
estimate: 3
weeks: 74
depends: MDV-P4-029, MDV-P4-030
confidence: 45 | Safe only on the PHI-free reporting store.
sources: DentalERP app/api/ai/query; lib/ai/skills/clinic-analyst.ts
desc:
The owner types a question ("revenue by doctor last month"). The AI service turns it into a read-only query on the reporting store (P4-029), runs it and shows the answer with the query used.
ac:
- Queries run only against the reporting store, read-only, with a row and time limit.
- The answer shows the query, and is labelled as an AI draft.
- No patient-identifying column is reachable.
